        }
      }
    },
    "The app is built in %@, and the listing has none of %@." : {
      "comment" : "Problem message in the problem list. The first value is a language code from the Xcode project. The second is a list of language codes for the App Store listing.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The app is built in %1$@, and the listing has none of %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The base price, converted, in the higher-income countries, and 60 percent of that everywhere else. The simplest thing that is not the default." : {
      "comment" : "Description of the Two prices price curve, shown under its name. The default is the Apple equalized price curve."
    },
    "The custom product pages have not been read yet." : {
      "comment" : "Reason beside the Custom Product Pages checkbox in the publish sheet, when nothing has read the pages."
    },
    "The deep link of %@ is not an address." : {
      "comment" : "Problem message in the problem list. The value is the name of a custom product page."
    },
    "The deep links, promotional text, keywords and images of the custom product pages." : {
      "comment" : "Help for the Custom Product Pages checkbox in the publish sheet. It says what a push of that part writes."
    },
    "The draft tests have not been read yet." : {
      "comment" : "Reason in the publish sheet that the Product Page Optimization part cannot be published yet."
    },
    "The file name decides. Make the locale field say %@, or rename the file." : {
      "comment" : "Fix in the problem list. The value is a language code. Do not translate locale. It is a JSON key."
    },
    "The file name sets the order Apple shows, so name them 01, 02 and so on." : {
      "comment" : "Fix in the problem list about screenshot file names. Keep 01 and 02 as they are. Do not translate Apple."
    },
    "The files as they arrived are in the Trash." : {
      "comment" : "Line in the report of the action that removes the alpha channel from screenshots. The original files are in the macOS Trash."
    },
    "The files are not used, and a push moves them to the Trash. To show them, take %@ out of usesSourceCreative." : {
      "comment" : "How to fix a problem in the problem list. Do not translate usesSourceCreative. It is a JSON key. The value is a language code. The files are the header and search results art in the folder of the language."
    },
    "The files are not used, and a push moves them to the Trash. To show them, take %@ out of usesSourceScreenshots." : {
      "comment" : "Fix in the problem list. The value is a language code. Do not translate usesSourceScreenshots, which is a JSON key. The files are the screenshots in the folder of the language."
    },
    "The files that were there are in the Trash." : {
      "comment" : "Line in the report after screenshots are filed, shown as fixed-width text. It comes after a list of languages that copied the new screenshots of a related language. The files are the screenshots those languages held before."
    },
    "The images of the treatments in the draft tests." : {
      "comment" : "Description of the Product Page Optimization part in the publish sheet. A treatment is one version of the product page in a test."
    },
    "The in-app purchases were not read, so there is nothing to write. Read App Store Connect first." : {
      "comment" : "Error sentence when a push of in-app purchases starts before the app reads App Store Connect. Do not translate App Store Connect."
    },
    "The name goes to App Store Connect with the image, and the next push looks for it there. Run asckit fix-names, or add or remove one image in this set, which names the whole set again." : {
      "comment" : "Fix in the problem list about screenshot names. Do not translate asckit fix-names. It is a command. Do not translate App Store Connect."
    },
    "The name, the subtitle and the privacy policy cannot be changed until a version is in Prepare for Submission." : {
      "comment" : "Error sentence when a push of text fails. Do not translate Prepare for Submission. It is a state name in App Store Connect."
    },
    "The name, the subtitle, the description, the keywords and what is new." : {
      "comment" : "Help text for the App Information checkbox in the publish sheet. It names the text fields that a push sends."
    },
    "The names and descriptions of the in-app purchases." : {
      "comment" : "Help text for the In-App Purchases checkbox in the publish sheet."
    },
    "The order has to name every file in the set, once each." : {
      "comment" : "Refusal of a new order of app previews."
    },
    "The order left out %@. Name every screenshot in the set." : {
      "comment" : "Error sentence when a person sets the order of screenshots. The value is a list of screenshot names."
    },
    "The override for %@ says nothing about what to charge." : {
