    },
    "The price for %@ names both an amount and a price point." : {
      "comment" : "Problem message in the problem list. The value is a country code. A price point is one fixed price on the list of prices of the App Store."
    },
    "The price is the top of that country's ladder. Lower the base price, or leave the country out." : {
      "comment" : "Fix in the problem list. The ladder is the list of fixed prices that the App Store sells in one country."
    },
    "The push went. The record of it could not be written: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Last line in the report of what a push did. The value is the error text from the system. The record is a file that the app writes after each push."
    },
    "The review note is %lld characters, and the limit is 4000." : {
      "comment" : "Problem message in the problem list about an in-app purchase. The count is the number of characters in the note for App Review. Keep 4000 as it is.",
