    },
    "The same four steps, cut much harder, down to a fifth. For a product that costs near nothing per extra customer. It wants installs and chart position more than revenue per customer." : {
      "comment" : "Description of the Emerging market push price curve, shown under its name. The four steps are four groups of countries by income. Chart position is the rank of the app on the App Store charts."
