    "The words of %@ are in a version that is %@, so App Store Connect refuses a change to them now." : {
      "comment" : "Reason in the publish plan for words that cannot go. The first value is an in-app purchase product id or a subscription group name, and it stays as it is. The second is a state such as in review.",
