    "There is no single .xcodeproj in %@. ASCKit reads the app out of the Xcode project, so use the folder that holds one." : {
      "comment" : "Error sentence when the app opens a project. The value is a folder name. Do not translate .xcodeproj, ASCKit or Xcode."
    },
    "This Xcode project builds more than one app: %@. ASCKit has to be told which one the listing is for." : {
      "comment" : "Error sentence when a person makes a new project from an Xcode project. The value is a list of app target names. Do not translate Xcode or ASCKit."
    },
    "This project has no %@. It lists %@." : {
