            "value" : "Version %1$@ is %2$@ and does not accept screenshots. Add a new version in App Store Connect first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@ is %@ and does not accept screenshots. Make the folder for version %@ first." : {
      "comment" : "Reason that the inbox files no screenshots, when the newest folder is the released version and App Store Connect already has a newer version. The first value is the released version number. The second is a state name from App Store Connect, such as READY_FOR_DISTRIBUTION. Do not translate the state name. The third is the newer version number.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
