    "Write a display name in at least one language. App Store Connect does not take a subscription for review without it." : {
      "comment" : "Fix in the problem list about a subscription group with no display name."
    },
    "Write a display name, or take the language out of the group file." : {
      "comment" : "Fix in the problem list about an empty display name on a subscription group."
    },
    "Write a price above zero, or skip the country." : {
      "comment" : "Fix in the problem list about a price set by hand for one country. Skip is a verb."
    },
    "Write a price above zero. A free product has no price plan at all." : {
      "comment" : "Fix in the problem list about the base price of an in-app purchase."
    },
    "Write it as 2026-09-01, or leave it out to start as soon as the write lands." : {
      "comment" : "Fix in the problem list about a price start date. Keep 2026-09-01 as it is. The word it refers to the date."
    },
    "Write it as hours, minutes, seconds and frames, such as 00:00:05:00, and keep it inside the video." : {
      "comment" : "How to fix a poster frame time code. Keep the example as it is."
