        }
      }
    },
    "You cannot charge any amount you like. The App Store offers a fixed ladder of prices in each country. ASCKit uses only its steps that end in .49 or .99, rounds every price up to the next one, and goes on from a .49 to the .99 above it. In a currency with no such steps, ASCKit takes the next step up." : {
